d television actor who starred in a number of television series and appeared in more than 150 feature films. He was the father of four children, including the actors ... \\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lloyd_Bridges\\\"},{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"navigation_not_evidence\\\",\\\"navigation_seen\\\":true,\\\"previously_received\\\":true,\\\"raw_ranges_delivered\\\":[],\\\"read_action\\\":{\\\"ref\\\":\\\"d59\\\"},\\\"ref\\\":\\\"d59\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\" ... Also the fact that the Harmon brothers are linked to this project make it seem like its a total case of nepotism at its finest. Probably Richard Harmon did his sister a favor but it shows he didn't put any effort into his acting and it's ... \\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt20116668/\\\"}],\\\"next_step\\\":\\\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\\\",\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"first_delivered_source_round\\\":null,\\\"prior_deliveries\\\":0,\\\"query_key\\\":\\\"e5351665f3a83438d6a430495962e042fcbdb1c0adeb9f49b2c4afd6b976564f\\\",\\\"replay_requested\\\":false,\\\"result_fingerprint\\\":\\\"a002791cdd4dc619918a574a11ad5d7c94f7ddcd0149930d878428f3722b6e4a\\\",\\\"semantic_progress\\\":\\\"not_measured\\\"},\\\"query\\\":\\\"Richard Harmon actor Wikipedia height\\\",\\\"view\\\":\\\"full\\\"},{\\\"cached\\\":false,\\\"hits\\\":[{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"navigation_not_evidence\\\",\\\"navigation_seen\\\":true,\\\"previously_received\\\":true,\\\"raw_ranges_delivered\\\":[],\\\"read_action\\\":{\\\"ref\\\":\\\"d41\\\"},\\\"ref\\\":\\\"d41\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\" ... MODELS OF THE 1990s\\\\n\\\\nModels acting: Denise Richards for Bonne Bell makeup (1991)\\\\n\\\\nYoung actress Angelina Jolie modeling for JC Penney (1992)\\\\n\\\\nMORE DRESSES: 100 vintage 80s prom dresses: See the hottest retro styles teen girls wore\\\\n\\\\nSpecies actress Natasha Henstridge for Lady Stetson perfume (1993)\\\\n\\\\nMORE: Remember ... \\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"https://clickamer